WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:13.378
It's a rainy day,

2
00:00:13.379 --> 00:00:23.970
I wear my raincoat.

3
00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:36.750
I wear my boots.

4
00:00:36.751 --> 00:00:47.853
I dress my dog too.

5
00:00:47.854 --> 00:00:59.033
I jump in the puddles.

6
00:00:59.034 --> 00:01:10.305
My dog jumps too.

7
00:01:10.306 --> 00:01:21.133
I sing and dance.

8
00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:32.279
My dog sings and dances too.

9
00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:44.549
I take a bath.

10
00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:56.525
My dog takes a bath too.

11
00:01:56.526 --> 00:02:14.945
We have cookies and hot chocolate.

